| Reproducer for a GCCSDK report: claims the physical page at this program's
| &8000 (as contiguous-memory drivers can), which RISC OS moves; then asks
| whether ARMEABISupport still finds the program. With ARMEABISupport 1.08:
| REPRODUCED, and *ARMEABISupport_Info lists an App left by it (reboot after).
Set UST$Dir <Obey$Dir>
WimpSlot -min 2000K
Run <UST$Dir>.pmovtest
